# agent_bridge/ Node dependencies — fetched via `npm install`, see
# aion-arch/changes/provider-configuration/proposal.md's Non-goals.
agent_bridge/node_modules/

# Aion's own project-bookkeeping data, written by the app itself when
# this checkout is registered as an Aion "project" root for dogfooding
# self-iteration. `/.aion/manifest.json` is deliberately TRACKED (not
# ignored) here — a small marker, cheap to commit. `/tickets/` and
# `/.aion/data/` are both ignored:
#
# - `/tickets/` — until AIO-2848, this project reused its own source
#   repo for ticket git-projection (the markdown mirror lived here,
#   tracked directly). AIO-2848 cut this project over to the separate-
#   tickets-repo option AIO-2844/2856/2857 built (`Project
#   .ticketsRootPath`, pointed at `ruansilvx/aion-tickets` — see
#   `Project.ticketsGitRootPath`'s dartdoc): the markdown mirror now
#   lives under `/.aion/tickets-repo/tickets/` instead, its own
#   separate git history. This repo no longer receives ticket-mirror
#   commits at all — `/tickets/`'s prior history stays in this repo's
#   log, but the directory itself is untracked and ignored going
#   forward, matching every other project that has opted into a
#   separate tickets repo.
# - `/.aion/data/` (the local SQLite DB + its ad hoc backups) is a
#   disposable, fully reconstructable cache of the ticket markdown
#   mirror (`TicketDbReconstructionService.reconstruct`), not a durable
#   artifact — binary, large, and churns on every write, exactly what
#   git shouldn't track. (Once a separate tickets repo is configured,
#   as here, this framing flips per `AIO-2848`: the DB is what stays
#   authoritative and the git mirror in `ruansilvx/aion-tickets` is
#   itself the disposable side — but `/.aion/data/` was never git-
#   tracked either way, so nothing changes about this ignore rule.)
#
# Both anchored to the repo root (`/`) — unanchored `tickets/`
# previously matched any directory named `tickets` anywhere in the
# tree, silently hiding new files under the real source directory
# `lib/features/tickets/` from `git status`.
/tickets/
/.aion/data/
/.aion/tickets-repo/